                <p>Apne doston ko invite karo aur har active referral par seedha 5 Bonus Coins apne wallet mein pao.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How to Install -->
    <section class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">App <span>Install</span> Kaise Karein?</h2>
        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step-row">
                <div class="step-num">1</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>APK Download Karein:</strong> Upar diye gaye "Download App Now" button par click karke Battle Blaze APK file download karein.
