        <p style="font-size: 0.72rem; margin-top: 6px;">Disclaimer: This is an independent esports tournament platform and is not affiliated with Garena International.</p>
    </footer>

    <!-- Terms & Refund Policy Modal -->
    <div class="modal" id="policyModal">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <h3>Terms, Refund & Fair Play Policy</h3>
            <p><strong>1. Non-Refundable Entry:</strong> Ek baar kisi tournament match mein join karne ke baad entry coins refundable nahi honge (jab tak match admin ki taraf se cancel na kiya jaye).</p>
